  "text_md": "## Sumitomo Mitsui Financial Group\n\n## ◆ Consolidated\n\n|                                                                                   | Millions of yen   | Millions of yen   | Millions of yen   | Millions of yen   | Millions of yen   |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------|-------------------|-------------------|-------------------|-------------------|\n| Year ended March 31                                                               | 2011              | 2010              | 2009              | 2008              | 2007              |\n| For the Year:                                                                     |                   |                   |                   |                   |                   |\n| Total income ................................................................     | ¥    3,862,660    | ¥    3,184,688    | ¥    3,556,536    | ¥    4,739,040    | ¥    3,947,786    |\n| Total expenses  .............................................................     | 3,035,346         | 2,626,590         | 3,527,040         | 3,810,084         | 3,140,996         |\n| Net income (loss) .........................................................       | 475,895           | 271,559           | (373,456)         | 461,536           | 441,351           |\n| Comprehensive income ...............................................              | 413,375           | -                 | -                 | -                 | -                 |\n| At Year-End:                                                                      |                   |                   |                   |                   |                   |\n| Total net assets  ............................................................    | ¥    7,132,073    | ¥    7,000,805    | ¥    4,611,764    | ¥    5,224,076    | ¥    5,331,279    |\n| Total assets  .........................................